    "HG02 public_spec lists rewards, checksum formulas, gates and legal actions, but does not explicitly describe the one-action transition cost or audit revelation semantics. Oracle regret compares with the exact simulator-informed Bellman policy; horizon mistakes are conditional on this interface.",
    "HG02 512 dimensions uses 64/48/32 parity/verification/authorization inputs versus 32/24/16 at 140. The dimension contrast also changes computational workload; it is not a pure nuisance-padding contrast.",
    "Direct and deliberative are instruction-wording conditions at the same requested low effort; direct is not a no-reasoning control.",
    "The provider does not expose an immutable backend snapshot, output-token cap, or complete built-in CLI scaffolding. These remain explicit provenance limits.",
    "HG08 explicit positive singleton certificates are sufficient but not necessary. Supplementary public GF2 rowspace checks can certify inferred positive singletons and are labelled post hoc transcript analysis."
